  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "B04b scope (remaining B04, grouped)",
      "items": [
        "Covers remaining B04 modules/routes not in B04a: storage (10), storage-access-key (3), voice-profile (6), plus remaining streaming/speech route groups (admin transcription 3; transcription job/session/mgmt routes beyond B04a representatives; text tasks/cancel/stream/providers/guardrail-providers/assembled + admin text generation routes; speech voices).",
        "Left side uses endpoint groups for readability because B04b spans ~50+ remaining routes. Each group node has controller sources; cards list route-level detail and examples.",
        "Reconcile final route counts against review/api_explore/inventory/summary.json and catalog.md when producing follow-up detail diagrams if strict per-endpoint node coverage is required."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Route groups and example I/O",
      "items": [
        "Storage /storage: GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE buckets, list/create/delete/get/presign files, GET health. Example input: create bucket {name}; upload multipart file to bucket. Output: bucket/file metadata and presigned URLs.",
        "Storage access keys /admin/tenants/storage/keys: GET list, POST generate, DELETE :id. Input: create key request. Output: key metadata; secret shown once on create.",
        "Voice profiles /voice-profiles: POST enroll (multipart audio files + label/agentSlug?), GET enrollment-target, GET list, PATCH :id/activate|deactivate, DELETE :id. Input: 1-3 audio files; output: VoiceProfileResponse; JWT-only/ForbidApiKey due to biometrics.",
        "Transcription/STT mgmt: POST create/batch/streaming jobs, GET stats/status/consultation/:id/language-modes/limits/:id, GET /:id/stream SSE, POST cancel/retry, session DELETE/refresh-ticket/switch-to-fallback/switch-to-primary; admin GET list/stats/status. Inputs/outputs follow TranscriptionJob/stream DTOs; SSE for live/stream endpoints.",
        "Text/speech ops: POST text-generations/generate/assembled, GET/POST tasks/:taskId, GET tasks/:taskId/stream, GET providers/guardrail-providers, admin POST admin/text-generations/generate|generate/assembled, GET /speech/voices. Inputs: prompt/context/template/provider routing fields (business plane restricts raw pinning). Outputs: TEXT/TTS proxied JSON or streams."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Evidence and limitations",
      "items": [
        "Repo: https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Sources point to controllers/services verified in local tree.",
        "Downstream: S3/MinIO/Azure blob storage (IBlobStorageService/S3Service), STT (STT_URL), TEXT (TEXT_URL), TTS (TTS_URL). Runtime URLs/config are deployment-specific.",
        "Limitations: endpoint-group nodes (not 1:1 endpoint boxes) for readability; example I/O summarized in cards; some handler-level service calls are represented by controller/service class sources rather than every internal call chain; TextGenerationAdminController handler line can be deepened in a follow-up pass."
      ]
    }
  ]
